Deactivate (Unpublish): Removes or deactivates published content.
Reverse Replication: Transfers content from Publish back to Author. Used in certain scenarios, such as user-generated content.
4. What is a Replication Agent?
A Replication Agent is responsible for transferring content between AEM environments.
